Z||000000||TooLowFiero||09-30-1999||06:40 PM||||ok heres my new problem with my 84 se     its really hard to shift gears its hard to get into reverse and first and second gear  thid and fourth gears shift easily and smooth       can some one help me ???????||||reg||8
